    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 51,
      "title": {
        "en": "Supportive doctors with reception concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners praise Dr. Jones, Dr. D’Intino, and the veterinary nurses for their warmth, attentiveness, and calm bedside manner. Clients appreciate thorough explanations during exams and urgent visits. However, several reviewers experienced rude reception interactions, difficult phone communication, and administrative hurdles when requesting records or medication refills."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective emergency care alongside complications"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many clients commend the clinic for prompt emergency interventions, successful surgical procedures, and accurate treatment of acute infections and breathing distress. Conversely, a handful of reviewers reported serious complications, including incomplete surgical outcomes or delayed diagnoses in complex cases, advising owners to monitor post-operative healing closely."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for beloved pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight the gentle, comforting care provided to dogs and cats during examinations and medical treatments. Reviewers note that veterinary assistants and doctors take extra time to calm nervous, hyperactive, or hurting pets. Pet parents express gratitude for the team's kind touch during routine check-ups and painful emergencies."
      }
    }
  ],
